# chorus golden vector: controller command (join), protocol v2 message type 0x32.
#
# Committed, and never written by a test. Any implementation of chorus protocol v2 must
# produce these exact bytes from the canonical input in controller_command_join.fields, and recover
# exactly those fields from them (docs/protocol.md, "Version 2").
#
# Format: whitespace separated hex bytes, '#' starts a comment.

# frame header: type 0x32, payload length 14 (0x000E), big-endian
32 00 0E

# command = 9 (join)
09

# value = 0
00 00

# target: length 10, then UTF-8 "Downstairs"
0A 44 6F 77 6E 73 74 61 69 72 73
